  "description": "In-memory lexical cache indexer with optional PT-BR stemming (Porter), phonetic (Soundex PT-BR), synonym dictionary expansion and pluggable cache providers (in-memory, distributed Redis/Garnet, composite, persistence channel). Includes a Background Service worker (PersistenceChannelWorker<T>) + DataDispatcher<T> for automatic replication to a DB via IPersistenceRepository<T>.",
